  "title": "Forestar Group Inc. to Release 2025 Third Quarter Earnings on July 22, 2025",
  "summary": "As previously announced, Forestar Group Inc. will release financial results for its third quarter ended June 30, 2025 on Tuesday, July 22, 2025 before the market opens. A replay of the call will be available after 3:00 p.m. ET on Tuesday, July 22, 2025 at 877-481-4010. When calling, please reference replay passcode",
